<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Quota-Report {{ summary.deployment }} — {{ summary.date }}</title>
<style>
  /* Inline-CSS, keine externen Ressourcen */
  body { font-family: sans-serif; color: #202020; margin: 1em; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 0.9em; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #c0c0c0; padding: 4px 8px; text-align: left; }
  th { background: #f0f0f0; }
  /* Schwellwert-Hervorhebung: >=80 % WARNUNG (gelb), >=95 % KRITISCH (rot) */
  tr.warn td.status { background: #ffe680; }
  tr.critical td.status { background: #ff9999; }
  .summary { margin-top: 1em; font-size: 0.9em; color: #404040; }
  .empty { padding: 1em 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h2>Quota-Report {{ summary.deployment }} — {{ summary.date }}</h2>
<p>
Geprüfte Mailboxen: {{ summary.n }} — Schwellwerte:
WARNUNG ab {{ summary.warn_percent }} %, KRITISCH ab {{ summary.critical_percent }} %.
{% if summary.mode == "below_threshold" %}Berichtsmodus: nur Mailboxen mit {{ summary.threshold_desc }}.{% endif %}
</p>
{% if rows %}
{% if groups %}
{% for tenant, trows in groups.items() -%}
<h3>Mandant {{ tenant }} ({{ trows | length }} Mailboxen)</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>Name</th><th>Mail-Adressen</th><th>Abteilung</th><th>Firma</th>
<th>Benutzt</th><th>Limit</th><th>Frei</th><th>Auslastung</th><th>Status</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for row in trows -%}
<tr class="{{ row.status_class }}">
<td>{{ row.name }}</td>
<td>{{ row.mail_primary }}{% if row.mail_aliases %} ({{ row.mail_aliases | join(", ") }}){% endif %}</td>
<td>{{ row.department }}</td>
<td>{{ row.company }}</td>
<td>{{ row.used }}</td>
<td>{{ row.limit }}</td>
<td>{{ row.free }}</td>
<td>{{ row.percent }}</td>
<td class="status">{{ row.status }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody>
</table>
{% endfor -%}
{% else %}
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>Name</th><th>Mail-Adressen</th><th>Abteilung</th><th>Firma</th>
<th>Benutzt</th><th>Limit</th><th>Frei</th><th>Auslastung</th><th>Status</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for row in rows -%}
<tr class="{{ row.status_class }}">
<td>{{ row.name }}</td>
<td>{{ row.mail_primary }}{% if row.mail_aliases %} ({{ row.mail_aliases | join(", ") }}){% endif %}</td>
<td>{{ row.department }}</td>
<td>{{ row.company }}</td>
<td>{{ row.used }}</td>
<td>{{ row.limit }}</td>
<td>{{ row.free }}</td>
<td>{{ row.percent }}</td>
<td class="status">{{ row.status }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody>
</table>
{% endif %}
{% if errors %}
<h3>Fehler (doveadm)</h3>
<ul>
{% for e in errors -%}
<li>{{ e }}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% endif %}
{% else %}
<p class="empty">Keine Mailboxen {% if summary.mode == "below_threshold" %}unter dem Schwellwert ({{ summary.threshold_desc }}){% else %}im Bericht{% endif %} — kein Handlungsbedarf.</p>
{% endif %}
<p class="summary">
Zusammenfassung: {{ summary.n }} Mailboxen geprüft, {{ summary.warn }} Warnung, {{ summary.crit }} kritisch,
{{ summary.no_ldap }} ohne LDAP-Eintrag, {{ summary.no_quota }} ohne Quota-Datensatz.
Automatisch erzeugt von mail-quota-report (Version {{ summary.version }}).
</p>
</body>
</html>
